==Finnish==

===Etymology===
Causative aspect of the verb {{m|fi|juoda||to drink}}; {{suffix|fi||alt1=juo-|ttaa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fi-IPA|*}}
* {{hyphenation|juot|taa|lang=fi}}
* {{rhymes|lang=fi|uotːɑː}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb|cat=causative}}

# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to [[give]] someone something to [[drink]]; to [[water]] (an animal); to [[make]] someone drink, to be [[pushy]] in [[offer]]ing something to drink, (often) to get [[drunk]]
#: {{ux|fi|'''Juotin''' [[lapsi|lapselle]] [[vesi|vettä]].|I '''gave''' the kid water '''to drink'''.}}
#: {{ux|fi|Näytelmässä Kleopatra '''juotti''' Caesarille myrkkyä.|In the play Cleopatra '''made''' Caesar '''drink''' poison.}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Juotin''' [[koira]]a. / '''Juotin''' [[koira]]n. / '''Juotin''' [[koira]]lle [[vesi|vettä]].|I '''watered''' the dog.}}
# to use milk to [[fatten]], to [[feed]] young animals meant for [[slaughter]]
# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to [[solder]]

